<div class="page">
  <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 36pt; color: #38761d;">Effective Performance Evaluations</h1>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 50px;">
    <li>Employee understands the purpose and knows the importance of the evaluation to him or her and the organization</li>
    <li>Performance standards are measurable and clearly related to the position description and organizational goals</li>
    <li>Objective, accurate, and solution-oriented (written by the supervisor)</li>
    <li>Supervisor clearly states performance, good or bad, and seeks employee's input</li>
    <li>Both the supervisor and the employee actively participate in the process</li>
  </ul>
  <div style="position: absolute; bottom: 50px; left: 60px;">
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="University Logo" style="width: 50px; height: auto;">
