<div class="page">
  <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 36pt; color: #38761d;">Performance Evaluation Development</h1>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 50px;">
    <li>Discuss with employee to ensure that the employee understands the process, performance standards, and how they will be measured</li>
    <li>Encourage employee input into the evaluation process, and incorporate appropriate suggestions</li>
    <li>Answer any questions the employee may have about the evaluation process or their position</li>
  </ul>
