  <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 36pt; color: #38761d;">Step 1: The Foundation – Position Descriptions</h1>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 50px;">
    <li>Accurate and up-to-date position descriptions are essential.
      <ul style="list-style-type: circle; padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 5px;">
        <li>Key responsibilities and qualifications</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li>If updated, be sure to submit signed version to HR.</li>
    <li>Position Description Template:
