  <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 36pt; margin-bottom: 30px;">After the Meeting</h1>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 40px;">
    <li>Make revisions to evaluation as discussed during meeting.</li>
    <li>Encourage the employee to provide employee comments on the evaluation.</li>
    <li>If warranted, provide a written response to employee comments (generally not needed).</li>
    <li>Obtain employee's signature on the final evaluation.</li>
    <li>Provide copy of evaluation to employee, and forward original to next level supervisor for signature.</li>
    <li>Follow up with employee throughout the year to discuss progress on performance issues that need to be assessed prior to next annual evaluation.</li>
  </ul>
